@prefix : <http://www.semanticweb.org/patient_monitoring_llm#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix xml: <http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://www.semanticweb.org/patient_monitoring_llm> a owl:Ontology .

### Базові класи, згенеровані LLM (22 класи)
:Patient a owl:Class .
:HealthcareProvider a owl:Class .
:Doctor a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :HealthcareProvider .
:Nurse a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :HealthcareProvider .

:MedicalDevice a owl:Class .
:VitalSign a owl:Class .
:HeartRate a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :VitalSign .
:BloodPressure a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :VitalSign .

:Symptom a owl:Class .
:MedicalCondition a owl:Class .
:Action a owl:Class .
:Sentiment a owl:Class .

# Некоректні та надлишкові класи від LLM (без деталізації фідбеків)
:MedicalReport a owl:Class .
:DoctorNotes a owl:Class .
:Prescription a owl:Class .
:TreatmentHistory a owl:Class .

### Спрощені властивості (без обмежень, Functional/Transitive чи Inverse)
:monitorsPatient a owl:ObjectProperty .
:treatsPatient a owl:ObjectProperty .
:hasSymptom a owl:ObjectProperty .
:hasVitalSign a owl:ObjectProperty .
:hasMedicalHistory a owl:ObjectProperty .

:hasAge a owl:DatatypeProperty .
:hasValueNumeric a owl:DatatypeProperty .